-- Shawcliffe demo clients — 12 showcase businesses, one per vertical archetype.
-- GENERATED FILE — do not edit by hand. Source of truth: scripts/demo-data.mjs.
-- Regenerate:  node scripts/seed-demos.mjs --emit-sql
--
-- Apply:  Supabase SQL editor (paste), or `supabase db push` / psql with the DB
--         password. Service-role only — clients/customers/etc. are RLS-protected.
-- Idempotent: fixed demo UUIDs + ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE. Safe to re-run; only
--         touches demo-* rows, never real clients.
--
-- Imagery: image_url / hero / logo point at the public `demo-assets` Storage
--         bucket. This SQL does NOT populate Storage — run the Node applier once
--         (`node scripts/seed-demos.mjs`) to upload the generated SVGs, or the
--         image URLs will 404. See platform/supabase/seed/README-demos.md.
--
-- CURRENT_DATE caveat: daily_status.date uses CURRENT_DATE at apply time, so the
--         storefront shows "open" only on the day you run this. Re-run to refresh.
-- ==========================================================================

